      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this property is set to <code>null</code> in which case the default\nIdGenerator of <a href=\"../MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> is used.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，此属性设置为 `<code>null</code>`，此时将使用<a href=\"../MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a>的默认 IdGenerator。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
